+// Package types contains provisional scalar compatibility types for v5.
+package types
+
+// Instant is the signed int64 millisecond codec of a caller-supplied default
+// axis. Zero is an ordinary coordinate, never an absence or infinity sentinel.
+// The numeric value does not identify a clock, epoch or reference system.
+// This candidate does not freeze the public v5 API or physical storage format.
+type Instant int64
